Subject: Re: [TMB users] Recommended way to check Matrix version for packages using TMB
Message-ID: <-GhmuuDP_OQ.Q3OEXVFMAAAJ@tmb-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <-GhmuuDP_OQ.nhEBnh9QAAAJ@tmb-users.groups.google.com>
References: <-GhmuuDP_OQ.STO9F11KAAAJ@tmb-users.groups.google.com> <-GhmuuDP_OQ.nhEBnh9QAAAJ@tmb-users.groups.google.com>
